WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.000
CHAD: And now, the high-stakes round!

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
You’re asked to analyze a spreadsheet
with employee feedback,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.000
performance notes,
or customer comments.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Stuff that’s a little… sensitive.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
Your manager says,
“Just drop it into ChatGPT

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.000
and see what trends pop up.”

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
But I’m over here
sweating virtual bullets.
